Nestor 5 reception centre
Sub-aquatic message
Provenance : the Pilobolus submarine
from : General Alex Kolman

Dear % &

I am on my way to our Rikiki naval base, it's high season
for surfing over there ! And lucky you, is the snow good ?

I have something for you, I have just been informed about
an important naval deployment in the east of your region.

It seems that something is coming, something big.

We have troops stationed at our allied base in case...

Well, I will transmit it to you straight away because we
are entering thermal layers.